            "review_text": "bluecramp\nVientiane, Laos3861 contributions\n0\nOne of the worst\nOct 2019 • Couples\nWe have been visiting Hanoi regularly for 25 years, spent about 3 years here in all, and tried most of the places in the old town. This place is popular with backpackers but I cant see why. Their fried rice at 140,000vnd is greasy with no veg and only tinned ham in it, and the smelled and tasted of very old oil. Other places nearby give a bigger portion of well made non greasy fried rice with seafood for 50,000vnd.\nThe beer wasnt cold and cost 10,000vnd more than 50m away.\nThey have been open for about 5 years now, no idea how - but it is telling that none of their customers are Vietnamese.\nRead more\nWritten October 19, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
