            "review_text": "Giles W\nPhnom Penh, Cambodia260 contributions\n0\nGrungy in the extreme - and not very beers\nOct 2019\nThere's been a craft brewing explosion in Vietnam over the past few years - but most of the new entrants in the market are still shockingly poor. I tried a few of the beers on offer here, and didn't find anything worth trying a second time.\n\nServing staff seem terminally bored, and not really wanting to do their job.\n\nAnd the place gives the appearance of NEVER HAVING BEEN CLEANED. It really has the ambience of a particularly grotty Student Union bar - but without any decent beer.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nWritten October 13, 2019",
