            "review_title": "Review at Beer 2ku",
            "review_text": "winter\nHanoi, Vietnam612 contributions\n0\nok experience\nJul 2019 • Couples\nThis is another one which may be easily overlooked. Like Vuvuzela, Beer 2KU seems to have an exclusive with a brewery, in this case, Hoan Kiem Brewery. 2KU has four crafties on offer, two of which are labelled as 2KU beer, though they are all made by Hoan Kiem Brewery. There is also a range of mass market beers available. Frankly, the beers are pretty good, and some of the cheapest craft beers you’ll find. They also have a food menu, though it is a little overpriced. 2KU gets quite busy in the evening, mainly with backpackers, so it is definitely a fun place to go for fine beers on a budget.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 18, 2019",
